# Working files that should not be served from emr-inc.net.

# NOTE, 2026-09-29: this file governs the VERCEL deployment, which serves the
# subdomains only. The emr-inc.net apex is GitHub Pages, publishing the whole
# `main` root straight from the branch, so nothing can be withheld from the apex
# by listing it here. Withholding a file from emr-inc.net means keeping it out of
# the branch. This was learned the hard way while unpublishing the dispatch
# capture: an entry here looked like it had worked and had not.

DESIGN-BRIEF.md
MIGRATION.md
build-standalone.py
*-standalone.html
experiments/
dns/
